## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\GloomsBuildBarn\Media\minimap.png

# The CurseForge project the packager uploads to. Pairs with the CF_API_TOKEN
# repo secret; remove either and the CurseForge step is skipped while the GitHub
# Release still gets cut. The CurseForge token is per ACCOUNT, so the same secret
# serves this addon and the Loot Advisor (which is project 1671489).
# See .github/workflows/release.yml for why CurseForge exists here at all.
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1671911

# Minimap button libraries (fetched by the packager into Libs/ at release time;
# absent in local dev, where MinimapButton.lua falls back to a self-contained
# button). WoW silently skips .toc entries whose files don't exist.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibDataBroker-1.1\LibDataBroker-1.1.lua
Libs\LibDBIcon-1.0\LibDBIcon-1.0.lua

# Load order matters: the baked data table must exist before Core reads it.
BuildData.lua
Core.lua
UI.lua
MinimapButton.lua
